	<name>Omarchy Media Writer</name>
	<summary>Create an Omarchy live USB drive</summary>
	<branding>
		<color type="primary" scheme_preference="light">#aad0ee</color>
		<color type="primary" scheme_preference="dark">#3c6eb4</color>
	</branding>
	<description>
		<p>A tool to create a bootable live USB drive with Omarchy. Omarchy Media Writer downloads the latest Omarchy ISO, checks it against its published checksum, writes it to your flash drive and verifies what was written. It is a fork of Fedora Media Writer.</p>
		<p>It can also write an Omarchy ISO you already downloaded, and restore the drive afterwards.</p>
	</description>
